   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "## Is anything broken?\nRead the four boxes below. **All green means everything is fine and you can close this page.** Anything red is listed underneath in plain words, with where to look next. The graphs at the bottom show whether the server itself is struggling."
   }
